FPGA Acceleration System of Data Readout for DNA Information Storage.
Autonomous track design for AMD Open Hardware Competition 2026.
Key Innovations:
1. Real-time sequence alignment and de-watermarking on FPGA logic.
2. Multi-position sliding window pipeline with massive bit-plane parallelism.
3. High-throughput differential voter and 5b4b desparsification architecture.
4. Energy efficiency exceeding multi-core CPU by 18x.
